Xm6_KernelSU_SUSFS build-system (scripts, workflows, configs):
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

Because this repository builds and repackages Linux kernel source
(LineageOS/android_kernel_sony_sm8650, GPL-2.0-only) together with
KernelSU (GPL-2.0-only) and SUSFS (GPL-2.0-only), all original files in
this repository are licensed under GPL-2.0-only as well.

The kernel Image / boot images produced by these scripts carry the
licenses of their respective upstream sources (kernel GPL-2.0, KernelSU
GPL-2.0, susfs4ksu GPL-2.0, AOSP mkbootimg tools Apache-2.0, AnyKernel3
scripts: BSD-3-Clause-style license from osm0sis - see below).

Vendored components and their licenses:
  tools/mkbootimg/*              Apache License 2.0 (AOSP, system/tools/mkbootimg, external/avb)
  AnyKernel3 (fetched at build)  BSD-3-Clause-style (Chris Renshaw / osm0sis @ xda-developers)
  kernel source (fetched)        GPL-2.0-only (The Linux Kernel Organization, LineageOS)
  KernelSU (fetched)             GPL-2.0-only (tiann)
  susfs4ksu (fetched)            GPL-2.0-only (simonpunk)

